        "2a1aec38-6408-4563-b266-035dad2de691": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Webhook trigger\n\nThe trigger creates a Toggl webhook subscription when the flow starts; Toggl must validate it (a PING answered by the trigger) before it sends events, so the provoking action waits 3 minutes. Do not remove the Wait. Toggl limits subscriptions per workspace (Free: 1, Starter: 2, Premium: 3): run the trigger flows one after another, and remove leftover subscriptions of stopped flows if the start fails with a limit error."
        }
